     <td style=\"width:400px;\">\n              \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/667c7b5ab458d55a15346991.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"400\">\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n          </tbody>\n\n        </table>\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n     \n    <div style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;border-width:0px;margin:0px auto 0px auto;border-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#ffffff;background-color:#ffffff;width:100%;border-radius:0px;\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;padding-top:10px;border-color:transparent;direction:ltr;font-size:0px;text-align:center;\">\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The SBA Just Rolled Over on Rollover Equity</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Sara,</span></p><p>Heads up, buyers and sellers\u2014especially the ones eyeing a little equity rollover in your next deal.</p><p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"442\">The SBA\u2019s latest revision to SOP 50 10 8 (effective June 1, 2025) just dropped, and it comes with a curveball that could change the way deals are structured.</p><p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"706\">Here\u2019s the big news:</p><p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"706\">If a seller keeps <em data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"490\">any</em> equity\u2014yes, even 1%\u2014they now have to personally guarantee the <em data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"561\">entire</em> SBA 7(a) loan. Not just their sliver of the pie. The whole thing. And that personal guarantee sticks around for two years after the deal closes.</p><p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"892\">Previously, this only kicked in if you owned 20% or more. So yes, this is a <em data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"789\">big</em> shift. One that could make some sellers think twice before hanging onto a small piece of the business.</p><p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"928\"><strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"928\">What does this mean for deals?</strong></p><p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"962\">Well, we\u2019re likely going to see:</p><ul data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1280\"><li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1119\"><p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1119\"><strong data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1004\">More caution with rollover equity.</strong> If you thought you\u2019d keep a toe in the water without getting soaked\u2014surprise! You're swimming in the deep end now.</p></li><li data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1280\"><p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1280\"><strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1162\">A stronger push for outside capital.</strong> Think investor-backed deals, seller notes structured outside SBA guidelines, or other creative financing workarounds.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1497\">This also means SBA lenders are going to be extra nosy about your deal structure. So if you're the buyer, make sure your legal and lending teams are in sync. And if you\u2019re the seller\u2014know what you\u2019re signing up for.</p><p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1680\">Of course, we\u2019ve seen SOPs evolve before. It\u2019s entirely possible this gets softened or reinterpreted later. But for now, this is theoretically going to be the rule. </p><p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1761\">Need help navigating SBA rules or deal structuring? That\u2019s kind of our thing.</p><p data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1826\">Until next time\u2014make smart deals and skip the surprises,<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><br>Sara Sharp<strong><br></strong>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Business Consultant &amp; Founder of Deal Academy</span></p><p><strong><em>P.S. If you're looking to buy or sell an accounting firm, and want me to keep an eye out for you, </em></strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/ecbab0f3c70?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>fill out this form here</em></strong></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\"><strong><em>.</em></strong></span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><p>For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/e059354f1f8?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Dealmakers Youtube Channel </span></a>where you'll find Sara's <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/1f0688f9b2c?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;v=csIoWCXhXsE&amp;t=15s\" title=\"Weekly Wine Down\"><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 37, 219); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 37, 219)\">Weekly Wine Down,</span></a> where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&amp;A Experts and Dealmakers.</p><p>You can check out some recent Dealmakers podcast episodes by clicking the images below.</p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"full\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"min-width:100%;max-width:100%;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"\">\n              \n        <a href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/9bed0edce81?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn\" target=\"_blank\">\n          \n      <img height=\"auto\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/msgsndr/oKvxmpgImkZb3TwM9ii4/media/67e5cbf86c46cc73b49e3367.jpeg\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;min-width:100%;width:100%;max-width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"520\">\n    \n        </a>\n      \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n     